cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use foxue.ai or its corpus in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "foxue.ai"
abstract: >-
  Multilingual Buddhist canon reader with paragraph-level citations: Chinese
  (CBETA Taisho), Pali (full Tipitaka), Sanskrit, and Tibetan (Derge Kangyur).
  Every passage points back to its source edition, version, and paragraph.
  Open source (Apache-2.0).
authors:
  - name: "foxue.ai contributors"
    website: "https://foxue.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/weitzu-com/foxue.ai"
url: "https://foxue.ai"
keywords:
  - Buddhism
  - Buddhist canon
  - digital humanities
  - Pali canon
  - Chinese Buddhist texts
  - Tibetan canon
  - Sanskrit
license: Apache-2.0
version: 6.18.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
